  "response_text": "Here is a list of the tasks I can assist you with, starting from the most recent:\n\n1. **Emails**:\n   - Send emails to recipients with specified subject, body, and optional attachments (files or calendar events).\n   - Delete emails from the inbox by their `email_id`.\n   - Retrieve all unread emails in the inbox, marking them as read after retrieval.\n   - Retrieve all sent emails in the inbox.\n   - Retrieve all received emails in the inbox.\n   - Retrieve all draft emails in the inbox.\n   - Search for emails in the inbox containing a specific query in the subject or body, optionally filtering by sender.\n   - Search for contacts by name or email.\n\n2. **Calendar**:\n   - Retrieve the current day in ISO format.\n   - Search for calendar events by query in the title or description, optionally filtering by date.\n   - Retrieve all appointments for a specific day.\n   - Create a new calendar event with title, start time, end time, description, participants, and location.\n   - Cancel a calendar event by its `event_id`.\n   - Reschedule a calendar event by updating its start and end times.\n   - Add participants to an existing calendar event.\n\n3. **Cloud Drive**:\n   - Append content to a file in the cloud drive.\n   - Search for files in the cloud drive by filename.\n   - Create a new file in the cloud drive with specified filename and content.\n   - Delete a file from the cloud drive by its `file_id`.\n   - Retrieve a file from the cloud drive by its `file_id`.\n   - Retrieve all files in the cloud drive.\n   - Share a file with a user by specifying their email and permission level (read or read-write).\n   - Search for files in the cloud drive by content.\n\nThis list is exhaustive, and no tasks have been omitted. Let me know how you'd like to proceed!",
